    <string name="about_title">About XiTing</string>
    <string name="about_section_app">About this app</string>
    <string name="about_intro">Want to just listen while watching? Tap the bubble and the screen goes fully black: backlight physically off, touches blocked, sound keeps playing — works with any video app.\n\nOptional night clock &amp; battery display (stays visible at minimum brightness after re-lock, content micro-shifts to protect OLED); incoming calls exit the black screen so you never miss one; sleep timer and \"finish this episode\" smart timer; headphones unplug returns you to video.\n\nAfter wake you can skip tracks: previous / play-pause / next (enable in Settings).\n\nEnergy Pet: listening earns growth points to evolve a five-form pet (Spark → Orb → Storm Cloud → Tempest → Thunder King), usable as your bubble avatar; achievements track your listening milestones.\n\nHome-screen widgets: three sizes with your pet, listening stats and one-tap screen-off; long-press the bubble to exit quickly.\n\nData backup: auto-backed up to the XiTing folder in Downloads (on device only), restored in one tap after reinstall. Everything stays on this device — no network permission.</string>
    <string name="about_section_privacy">Privacy &amp; Security</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">· No INTERNET permission: physically cannot go online\n· Reads nothing on your screen\n· All data stays on this device (system cloud backup and device transfer are explicitly disabled)\n· A backup file is written only when you tap Export, into the Download/XiTing folder, and stays under your control\n· Notification counts are read only after you grant Notification Access, solely for the black-screen badge; notification titles and contents are never read, and the feature stays off entirely without your permission\n· The app embeds a build identifier (build ID and channel, used only to trace pirated copies; it contains no device information)\n· No ads, no tracking, no analytics</string>
    <string name="about_section_open">Open Source &amp; Contact</string>
    <string name="about_github">GitHub: github.com/ch1209498273/XiTing\n(Tap to open the project page)</string>
    <string name="about_feedback">Feedback: 1209498273@qq.com</string>
    <string name="about_section_license">License</string>
    <string name="about_license">Non-commercial license (see LICENSE): free to use and share for personal learning with attribution; any commercial use prohibited; removing or altering attribution/tracing marks forbidden.\n\nThis project is not affiliated with YouTube, Google or any video platform. For study only — please support official releases.</string>
